			rgCommunityRecommendations: [{"appid":1368140,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232457386","appid":1368140,"accountid":37554667,"playtime_at_review":1454,"review_text":"absolutely addicted to this game. If you like pirates, city builders, and automation with a bit of rpg elements then you will love this. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197997820395\/recommended\/1368140\/","votes_up":5}]},{"appid":4113940,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232465904","appid":4113940,"accountid":44919842,"playtime_at_review":2085,"review_text":"9\/10 well worth the money. small typos here and there, some things are a bit jank but 30+ hours of gameplay in 3 days time, enough said.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198005185570\/recommended\/4113940\/","votes_up":10}]},{"appid":1478500,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232462019","appid":1478500,"accountid":444696170,"playtime_at_review":192,"review_text":"This game is the fastest way to realise a group of friends is incapable of following simple directives like \"let's regroup and choose a destination together\" or \"please don't wander off for 1 minute I'm begging you\" 10\/10","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198404961898\/recommended\/1478500\/","votes_up":90},{"recommendationid":"232464034","appid":1478500,"accountid":428718192,"playtime_at_review":635,"review_text":"The final boss of friend games. At first I was skeptical of the price tag, but it's worth it. The game is almost perfectly done, without bugs, with a lot of thinking and beautifully drawn. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198388983920\/recommended\/1478500\/","votes_up":19},{"recommendationid":"232486654","appid":1478500,"accountid":353484429,"playtime_at_review":271,"review_text":"This game was made for me in a lab. I've been wanting a game to just explore in with friends, with no survival crafting gimmicks and lots of \"oh what's that??!!\" moments. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198313750157\/recommended\/1478500\/","votes_up":4},{"recommendationid":"232472217","appid":1478500,"accountid":59388680,"playtime_at_review":710,"review_text":"Great coop game to play with friends, best played at exactly 4. You get to walk (a lot! it's fun!) and solve a very large variety of communication-based puzzles.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198019654408\/recommended\/1478500\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"232472861","appid":1478500,"accountid":9185783,"playtime_at_review":944,"review_text":"This was a good experience that has a different sort of vibe depending on who you are partnered with, or if you are in a group setting. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197969451511\/recommended\/1478500\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"232472796","appid":1478500,"accountid":26727047,"playtime_at_review":937,"review_text":"A beautiful experience where you can take a break from the fast paced shooters and RPGs to just stop and appreciate your friends. The moments where you are forced to communicate through emotes and hand motions makes you...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197986992775\/recommended\/1478500\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":1297900,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232512277","appid":1297900,"accountid":42263709,"playtime_at_review":3510,"review_text":"Great exploration and setting. Was great walking around and looking into every nook. A tad janky like the original and some crashes but nothing too bad. Turned some settings down","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198002529437\/recommended\/1297900\/","votes_up":2},{"recommendationid":"232463235","appid":1297900,"accountid":54239989,"playtime_at_review":4022,"review_text":"Do I prefer the original over the remake? Probably. Do I think anyone unacquianted with Gothic should try and play the original today? Hell no. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198014505717\/recommended\/1297900\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":3812600,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232473998","appid":3812600,"accountid":22086263,"playtime_at_review":250,"review_text":"Could use additional music tracks, but the joy of repairing tech from my childhood is a relaxing and pleasant time. I cannot reccomend this game enough you were lucky enough to be alive during that time.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197982351991\/recommended\/3812600\/","votes_up":17},{"recommendationid":"232469119","appid":3812600,"accountid":68742102,"playtime_at_review":763,"review_text":"loved the demo, the full game does not disappoint. one small nitpick, some of the achievements seem grindy.","review_text_truncated":false,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198029007830\/recommended\/3812600\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"232501822","appid":3812600,"accountid":72673042,"playtime_at_review":297,"review_text":"This game is super chill. The lo-fi music and Japanese atmosphere really pull you into the game. The gameplay is pretty easy to master, and the story is quite interesting. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198032938770\/recommended\/3812600\/","votes_up":3},{"recommendationid":"232471756","appid":3812600,"accountid":870388453,"playtime_at_review":482,"review_text":"I am absolutely in love with this game, there is story and there is also cozy vibes alongside the main part of the game, running your workshop of course! ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198830654181\/recommended\/3812600\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":3417410,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232491521","appid":3417410,"accountid":355649406,"playtime_at_review":340,"review_text":"This game has a nice retro aesthetic. Some of the puzzle designs are quite interesting, and the atmosphere and sound effects are both well done. The sanity system adds a lot of fun to the gameplay. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198315915134\/recommended\/3417410\/","votes_up":7}]},{"appid":4547970,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232478949","appid":4547970,"accountid":795051805,"playtime_at_review":567,"review_text":"10\/10. Pih 2 Is More Than a Game. It Is a Lifestyle. I Installed Pih 2 expecting a video game, what I received instead was a life altering out of body experience that has permanently rearranged the contents of my brain. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198755317533\/recommended\/4547970\/","votes_up":17},{"recommendationid":"232466538","appid":4547970,"accountid":1526373593,"playtime_at_review":133,"review_text":"This game demonstrates an absolute masterclass in modern level design. Pih 2 is truly able to strike a golden balance of difficulty where it challenges the player but simultaneously makes it fair and fun. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199486639321\/recommended\/4547970\/","votes_up":2}]},{"appid":1067360,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232514907","appid":1067360,"accountid":460364173,"playtime_at_review":175,"review_text":"EDIT : Thanks for the steam points everyone, saving up for anything cool! :) This is the MOST FUN i ever had in a game so far this year, really. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198420629901\/recommended\/1067360\/","votes_up":32}]},{"appid":4333200,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232518129","appid":4333200,"accountid":8960679,"playtime_at_review":93,"review_text":"First, I loved This Bed We Made. I was super excited to play this new entry and I was spoiled. The last stretch of the game put me through a real range of emotions. A few conversations in particular got to me. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197969226407\/recommended\/4333200\/","votes_up":5},{"recommendationid":"232465739","appid":4333200,"accountid":10170834,"playtime_at_review":215,"review_text":"If you enjoyed The Bed We Made, then I can guarantee you'll enjoy Lost and Found as it continues exactly where that game left off. The style and atmosphere, the mystery, the snooping around, finding clues and slowly piecing...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561197970436562\/recommended\/4333200\/","votes_up":3}]},{"appid":3787240,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232516090","appid":3787240,"accountid":101988601,"playtime_at_review":257,"review_text":"If you're seeing negative reviews and wondering why, It launched in a near unplayable bad state. It remained that way for a few days, but as of August 10th, 2026, the performance issues have been fixed with a 10GB patch, so...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198062254329\/recommended\/3787240\/","votes_up":36}]},{"appid":892970,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232506859","appid":892970,"accountid":1159674019,"playtime_at_review":2416,"review_text":"I absolutely love Valheim. Playing on a server with my friends makes the experience even better, and there\u2019s honestly a little bit of everything to enjoy. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561199119939747\/recommended\/892970\/","votes_up":5}]},{"appid":550,"reviews":[{"recommendationid":"232461007","appid":550,"accountid":307390925,"playtime_at_review":47466,"review_text":"A 2009 Game That Aged Like The Purest Wine You play as Coach, Ellis, Nick and Rochelle, four survivors trying to make their way through a zombie apocalypse from Savannah to New Orleans. ...","review_text_truncated":true,"review_link":"https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/profiles\/76561198267656653\/recommended\/550\/","votes_up":5}]}],
